      <Description>
        <LocalizedDescription Lang="en-US"><![CDATA[Current state of CIP Axis 
   
0:  Initializing,    
1: Pre-Charge,  
2: Stopped,
3: Starting,
4: Running, 
5: Testing,
6: Stopping,
7: Aborting, 
8: Faulted, 
9: Start Inhibited, 
